# Party banter in the catacombs part of Castle Ravenloft (docs/regions/castle_ravenloft_catacombs.md). Each node
# opens with an `if` gate (the castle's banter plays anywhere in the region, so each says where it belongs).

~ banter_rows
if at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs and not flag.strahd_in_coffin and name:thistle and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:thistle: Stone boxes for sleeping in. Forever. And I thought towns were bad.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Every one with somebody home, too. Keep walking, and don't knock.
endif
-> END

~ banter_wand
if at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs and item:arcane_focus_wand and name:ratatoille and name:kip_smudgewick
interject name:ratatoille: Ash, badly balanced, a chip out of the grip. A truly dreadful wand. Somebody loved him enough to bury him with it.
interject tag:cheerful: And he loved us enough to leave it lying about. Everybody wins.
interject name:kip_smudgewick: I'd leave something in exchange, all the same. Only all I've got is apricots.
endif
-> END

~ banter_names
if at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs and not flag.strahd_destroyed and name:kip_smudgewick and name:liriel_dawnsong
interject name:kip_smudgewick: Cooks, grooms, a steward. All in rows, all labelled. He keeps his servants like a ledger.
interject tag:blunt: Or a man who doesn't let anybody leave.
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: Every one of them was somebody's child. I'll say their names as we pass.
endif
-> END

~ banter_sergei
if flag.cat_ireena_at_tomb and guest:ireena and at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs_tombs
interject guest:ireena: I'm fine. I'll tell you when I'm not. Right now I'd like to go and kill someone.
interject tag:loyal: Then we'll go together.
endif
-> END

~ banter_parents
if at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs_tombs and not flag.strahd_in_coffin and name:godrick_pendlebrook and name:thistle
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: A king and a queen and their boys, all in stone. And one face scratched clean off. That's sad, that is.
interject name:thistle: He did that himself. Nobody else would dare.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Then it's sadder.
endif
-> END

~ banter_coffin
if flag.strahd_in_coffin and not flag.strahd_destroyed and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: He's down there in his coffin. Morninglord, hold him there a little longer. That's all I ask.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Right. Stairs. Coffin. Stake. In that order, and nobody stops for anything.
endif
-> END

~ banter_guardians
if flag.cat_guardians_stilled and at:castle_ravenloft_catacombs_tombs
interject tag:veteran: Six statues, and three of them were empty armour that walked. I'll be checking every statue in this castle twice now.
interject class:wizard: Three of those statues were simply statues. I checked. Twice.
endif
-> END
